        "note": "The approved audit shorthand also says interior moves of both sections. It is not proof beyond rawB044 and needs additive qualification in the successor response/research or separately scoped audit addendum. Do not rewrite the sealed audit or treat its earlier zero-credit proposal as normative authority."
